flowchart TD
    A["POST /api/reminders (Receive Reminder List)"]
    B["For each product: Try Retailer APIs"]
    C["If API fails, use Aggregator API"]
    D["If still not found, use Google Places API"]
    E["If all else fails, fallback to Web Scraping"]
    F["Aggregate Store Addresses"]
    G["Geocode Addresses (if needed)"]
    H["Return Store Coordinates to Mobile App"]

    A --> B
    B -- "Success?" --> F
    B -- "Fail" --> C
    C -- "Success?" --> F
    C -- "Fail" --> D
    D -- "Success?" --> F
    D -- "Fail" --> E
    E --> F
    F --> G
    G --> H

    %% Notes
    B -.->|"Retailer APIs: Walmart, Carrefour, etc."| C
    C -.->|"Aggregator APIs: Google Shopping, etc."| D
    D -.->|"Google Places API for store types"| E
    E -.->|"Web scraping as last resort"| F 